---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Kannrisha and these field notes.">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>About me</h1>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="content-shell about-simple">
    <p class="about-intro">My name is Adam, often known online as <span>kannrisha</span>.</p>

    <section class="dictionary-entry" aria-labelledby="kanrisha-entry">
      <div class="dictionary-headword">
        <h2 id="kanrisha-entry">
          <ruby>管<rt>かん</rt>理<rt>り</rt>者<rt>しゃ</rt></ruby>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="dictionary-copy">
        <p class="part-of-speech">Noun</p>
        <div class="dictionary-definition">
          <div>
            <p class="definition-title"><strong>root (user)</strong> <span>Computing</span></p>
            <p class="japanese-example" lang="ja">
              <ruby>管理用画面<rt>かんりようがめん</rt></ruby>に<ruby>管理者<rt>かんりしゃ</rt></ruby>しかアクセスできないようにしました。
            </p>
            <p class="english-example">I made it so only root could access the administrative screen.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="about-bio">
      I am a CTF player from the Faculty of Computer Science, Universitas Indonesia. I usually participate in CTF competitions with my friends in uni, usually doing binary exploitation and reverse engineering. Currently, I am expanding my skills by learning web exploitation and other areas of cybersecurity, as well as fields beyond it :O
    </p>

    <section class="selected-ctfs" aria-labelledby="selected-ctfs-heading">
      <h2 id="selected-ctfs-heading">Selected CTFs</h2>
      <p class="ctf-intro">
        Besides playing in local CTFs, I also compete internationally with <strong>CSUI / Universitas Indonesia</strong>. You can find our team on <a href="https://ctftime.org/team/70551" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">CTFtime</a>.
      </p>
      <h3>International CTFs</h3>
      <div class="ctf-table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Competition</th><th>Team</th><th>Position</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>HackTheBox University CTF 2025</td><td>Universitas Indonesia</td><td>4th Place</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3>Local Indonesian CTFs</h3>
      <div class="ctf-table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Competition</th><th>Team</th><th>Position</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>FIT Competition CTF 2025</td><td>frontshots</td><td>1st Place</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Techomfest CTF 2026</td><td>frontshots</td><td>1st Place</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Netcomp CTF 4.0</td><td>frontshots</td><td>1st Place</td></tr>
            <tr><td>GEMASTIK Cybersecurity Division (CTF)</td><td>ijazahnya mana woy</td><td>Best Defender</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Schematics Capture The Flag ITS 2025</td><td>frontshots</td><td>3rd Place</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
